// See docs/API.md (PAGE seam) and the archived RPC_PATTERNS_AND_VERBS_PLAN plan §4.
//
// PAGE is a unary RPC: the client drives a resumable window with an opaque
// page_token. The generated wrapper owns the token codec and the page_size
// bounds; the handler is a keyset producer that returns a Page and the cursor
// for the next window. The token is an opaque, versioned base64url value over
// the method's order_by key — identical on every language backend so a token
// minted by one client decodes on any other.
